+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Subscribes a device to push notifications. Everything that lands in the user's notification tray is then also pushed to that device.
+
+The values come from the [`PushSubscription`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PushSubscription) the browser gets from its push service. Posting a subscription that's already known refreshes its keys. You can only subscribe devices for yourself.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The URL of the push service that delivers to this device |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The public key of the subscription |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The authentication secret of the subscription |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscriptions/abc123",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNc...",
+    "auth_key": "k9X..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
